    "detailed_description": "The controls are easy!<br />\r\nTwo buttons to turn the world, roll the ball and hit the switch!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to play:<br />\r\nPress the button to turn the stage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Stages<br />\r\nOver 200 stages! From simple ones to absolute brain busters, there are tons of challenges to take on!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Balls<br />\r\nEarn points by clearing stages.<br />\r\nUse those points to unlock a variety of balls to use.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Create<br />\r\nIn this mode, you can build your own stage.<br />\r\nMake something fun for your family and friends to try!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Battle<br />\r\nBattle with up to four players!<br />\r\nThe person who can clear the various stages fastest wins.<br />\r\nFinish as fast as you can in this five-set match!",
